From 394f6fa1e4167327d9ef02501b24d46e363e4c9b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: baihe-liu <baihe.liu@intel.com>
Date: Wed, 10 Jun 2026 10:23:34 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 2/7] Add lazy set static shape

Optimize multi-camera attention and fix input seed

Replace per-chunk Python attention loops with a batched matmul path
for equal-size camera chunks during OV export. Keep the existing
chunked fallback for uneven sequence lengths.

Fixed input Generation using seed
Usage: --input-seed 0   --diffusion-seed 0

Add arg to set torch num thread

Signed-off-by: He Yue <yue.he@intel.com>
Signed-off-by: Liu Baihe <baihe.liu@intel.com>
